    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>line-merge-keys · 2×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 512 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-line-merge-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-line-merge-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const lineOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; lineOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const keyYOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; keyY: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const keyXOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; keyX: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const endpointIdsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; endpointIds: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const LINE_COUNT: u32 = 223u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">const NONE: u32 = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const INVALID_KEY: u32 = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">const DIRECTED: bool = false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">fn isFiniteBits(x: f32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">  return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(x) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"25\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"26\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  _ = &amp;lineOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  _ = &amp;keyY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  _ = &amp;keyX;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  _ = &amp;endpointIds;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  let line = index / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  let first = lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + line];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  let last = lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + line + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  endpointIds[endpointIdsOffset + index] = index;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">  var x = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  var y = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  var valid = last &gt;= first + 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  if (valid) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">    let vertex = select(first, last - 1u, (index &amp; 1u) == 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">    x = positions[positionsOffset + vertex * 2u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">    y = positions[positionsOffset + vertex * 2u + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">    valid = isFiniteBits(x) &amp;&amp; isFiniteBits(y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  if (valid) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">    x = select(x, 0.0, x == 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">    y = select(y, 0.0, y == 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">    keyX[keyXOffset + index] = bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(x);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">    keyY[keyYOffset + index] = bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">    keyX[keyXOffset + index] = INVALID_KEY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">    keyY[keyYOffset + index] = INVALID_KEY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"positions\">positions</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>lineOffsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"lineOffsets\">lineOffsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>keyY<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"line-merge-key-y\">line-merge-key-y</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>keyX<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"line-merge-key-x\">line-merge-key-x</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>endpointIds<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"line-merge-endpoint-ids\">line-merge-endpoint-ids</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPULineMerge/keys · main · 081e1316</figcaption></figure></section>",
